[{"client_msg_id":"1083f33a-9c2d-4e45-89a6-0bb3b51c4e07","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"まぁそりゃそうだよねw","ts":"1630044582.007900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DXC6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d69122c4-a69c-49e4-a0f7-ab71cfecfd38","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"それ *.c や *.m には書き込まれないので困りました","ts":"1630044570.007700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+gowm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e0c455a-4a6a-4a76-93fe-2739419e3601","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"Go 1.17 で gofmtしたら `//go:build` が必要なところには書き足されたな。","ts":"1630044465.007200","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1630044474.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kO1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04652b70-1aaf-45a3-b6bf-a047ada4cb21","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"日本のmemeにするならさしずめ「何って・・・Go1.17にupgradeしただけだが？」というところか。","ts":"1630025798.005900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"100","count":7,"users":["U03C4RC8X","U06ECBRTJ","UAZ33BKV2","U03C6TEAZ","UEACRCY0Z","U8CC7MDCL","U023ANT1TME"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bKB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f8fe8be1-af72-4b33-8fe1-9f22f61d8f9b","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"アメリカンジョークって感じだ。","ts":"1630025709.005100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ityK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4600737d-338b-47cf-8ca0-be756f538e2e","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/dgryski/status/1431021823018209287\u003e","ts":"1630025701.004700","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/dgryski|@dgryski\u003e: \"Nice drop in the graphs.  What was the optimization?\"\n\n\"Just upgraded #golang to 1.17\" \u003chttp://twitter.com/__Achille__/st|twitter.com/__Achille__/st\u003e…","id":1,"author_name":"Damian Gryski","author_subname":"@dgryski","author_link":"https://twitter.com/dgryski/status/1431021823018209287","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/59859794/dmg-simpsons-head_normal.png","text":"\"Nice drop in the graphs.  What was the optimization?\"\n\n\"Just upgraded #golang to 1.17\" \u003chttp://twitter.com/__Achille__/st|twitter.com/__Achille__/st\u003e…","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1630017164,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/dgryski/status/1431021823018209287","original_url":"https://twitter.com/dgryski/status/1431021823018209287"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8PpHU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"522a0cb3-f45a-431a-8847-1e3cf37a5272","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"ISUCONでも1.17にするだけで改善したって話があったし、上げ得ですねえ","ts":"1630025258.004500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AdXr3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9baea010-9b52-4221-b065-f3fabb326dcf","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"呼び出し規約の変更(=関数コールの引数にレジスタ使うようになった)は効くと思うよ。メモリの書き込みは、レジスタにくらべて軽く10倍かそれ以上のオーダーだから。","ts":"1630024096.004000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YWbq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc0dfdc7-99fc-4ece-8431-58bc0aece53b","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"最後のメモリのやつは違うと思うけど。","ts":"1630024002.002800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PtyH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B27C600C-128E-433B-B5CF-05F983F105D8","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"レジスタベースでそんなに変わるのか","ts":"1630023647.002500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ov0=3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"93516e66-1c8a-42d4-93b0-263f39ba6861","type":"message","user":"UEACRCY0Z","text":"これの影響でしょうか？\n\n\u003chttps://golang.org/doc/go1.17#compiler\u003e\n\u0026gt; Go 1.17 implements a new way of passing function arguments and results using registers instead of the stack.","ts":"1630023487.002000","attachments":[{"fallback":"Go 1.17 Release Notes - The Go Programming Language","id":1,"title":"Go 1.17 Release Notes - The Go Programming Language","title_link":"https://golang.org/doc/go1.17#compiler","text":"Go is an open source programming language that makes it easy to build simple, reliable, and efficient software.","blocks":null,"service_name":"golang.org","service_icon":"https://golang.org/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://golang.org/doc/go1.17#compiler","original_url":"https://golang.org/doc/go1.17#compiler"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c7q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3e32eea-3642-4c4a-92da-128546c46f15","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"すごい差がでるんか","ts":"1630022799.001300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gqsg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"901d66bc-5fb6-4624-b4a7-65ca56c273db","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/__Achille__/status/1431014148800802819\u003e","ts":"1630022766.001000","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/__Achille__|@__Achille__\u003e: The Go 1.17 upgrade on a large scale data processing system has yielded amazing results: ~15% drop in CPU time, malloc calls, and a RSS size that is much closer to the heap size (down from 1.6GB to 1GB)! \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E9v43FeVIAAqgPo.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"Achille","author_subname":"@__Achille__","author_link":"https://twitter.com/__Achille__/status/1431014148800802819","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1054213587500130304/9MHUxPzq_normal.jpg","text":"The Go 1.17 upgrade on a large scale data processing system has yielded amazing results: ~15% drop in CPU time, malloc calls, and a RSS size that is much closer to the heap size (down from 1.6GB to 1GB)! \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E9v43FeVIAAqgPo.jpg\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/E9v43FeVIAAqgPo.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1630015334,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/__Achille__/status/1431014148800802819","original_url":"https://twitter.com/__Achille__/status/1431014148800802819"},{"id":2,"text":"\u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E9v48moVgAQRO9A.jpg\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/E9v48moVgAQRO9A.jpg","blocks":null},{"id":3,"text":"\u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E9v4-0fVoAE9K3M.jpg\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/E9v4-0fVoAE9K3M.jpg","blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XCvt"}]}]
